# Force Windows-style line endings on .bat / .cmd files. Some cmd.exe
# builds (notably French Windows installs) refuse to execute LF-only
# scripts and the window closes silently — the launcher does nothing
# and the tester is stuck. CRLF guarantees both git on Linux/macOS and
# the GitHub Actions Windows runner ship the file correctly.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.ps1   text eol=crlf

# Everything else stays LF.
*       text=auto
